    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crunda is a trail across the Asteroid Belt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap, dive and slam your way across the route in this unique physics speedrunning platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysteries of Crunda's wobbly whimsical world or challenge your friends to tackle the world record table!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wobbly physics platformer </strong>- Fight against gravity and launch yourself between worlds modeled with a bespoke set of physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the mysteries of the whimsical world -</strong>\u00a0Uncover the stories of the motley bunch of characters inhabiting this microgravity backwater.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tackle the world record table\u00a0-</strong>\u00a0Hunt gold medals on levels or attempt world record table. Spectate the ghosts of record runs and improve on their strategies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327020/extras/395234f33e570bb1249560c504a8879b.avif?t=1748707459\" width=500 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crunda is a trail across the Asteroid Belt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap, dive and slam your way across the route in this unique physics speedrunning platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysteries of Crunda's wobbly whimsical world or challenge your friends to tackle the world record table!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wobbly physics platformer </strong>- Fight against gravity and launch yourself between worlds modeled with a bespoke set of physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the mysteries of the whimsical world -</strong>\u00a0Uncover the stories of the motley bunch of characters inhabiting this microgravity backwater.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tackle the world record table\u00a0-</strong>\u00a0Hunt gold medals on levels or attempt world record table. Spectate the ghosts of record runs and improve on their strategies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327020/extras/395234f33e570bb1249560c504a8879b.avif?t=1748707459\" width=500 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
